-reveals-climate-nz-extreme.html"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Researchers used AI to run hundreds of climate simulations much faster than conventional models, producing better regional projections of how a warming climate will intensify New Zealand''s most extreme downpours. The approach aims to give communities better information for preparing for extreme rainfall.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ml_dl"], "title": "AI reveals how a warming climate will intensify NZ most extreme downpours", "value_added": "Runs hundreds of climate simulations much faster than conventional models, enabling better regional projections of extreme rainfall for communities to prepare.", "value_types": ["accuracy", "other", "resolution", "speed"], "wmo_regions": ["V"]}');
